<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0F172A', padding: '20px 64px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 80, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 38, background: 'linear-gradient(180deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0' }}>模块五 · 部署联调（陈浩研）</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B5CF6', marginLeft: 12, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>可运行 · 可部署 · 可上线</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '47%', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '12px 16px', background: 'rgba(139,92,246,0.12)', borderRadius: 10, borderLeft: '4px solid #8B5CF6' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>定位：从「能跑」到「<span style={{ color: '#8B5CF6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>能上线</span>」的最后一公里。</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>docker-compose</span>：服务编排，一键拉起前后端与依赖。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Caddy</span>：反向代理 + HTTPS，外网安全暴露。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• <span style={{ color: '#3B82F6', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>CI/CD（GitHub）</span>：提交即自动构建与部署。</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16.5, color: '#CBD5E1', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>• 组长守<span style={{ color:'#8B5CF6' }}>全局质量门禁</span>：跨模块联调与回归。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '53%', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <svg width='540' height='300' viewBox='0 0 540 300'>
        <defs>
          <marker id='ar24' markerWidth='9' markerHeight='9' refX='7' refY='3' orient='auto'>
